        <mxCell id="adr010" value="Each moment has its own RAP, criteria and levels with scores, defined by the admin in each academic period; nothing is fixed in the code (ADR-010).&lt;br&gt;The final grade is a weighted average by kind of evaluator (the teacher and each &lt;i&gt;EvaluatorType&lt;/i&gt;), with the weights the admin sets in each moment." style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#D4A017;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1F2937;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="835" y="1215" width="475" height="96" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
