        <mxCell id="scope" value="Filtering is applied in the service layer (&lt;i&gt;AccessScope&lt;/i&gt; and the rules of each service), not in the user interface. A teacher only sees and grades the groups they enabled; an admin only manages their faculty; students see every group of the moment of their semester to join one, and then only their own group; external evaluators only see and grade the groups assigned to them." style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#D4A017;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1F2937;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1400" y="1392" width="870" height="92" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
